# TOEIC Part 5 — Day41

## Q1

If the company _____ its budget, it would be able to purchase new equipment.

(A) increases
(B) increased
(C) will increase
(D) increasing

**정답: B**

→ 가정법 과거

> If + 과거형, would + 동사원형

---

## Q2

If I _____ you, I would review the contract before signing it.

(A) am
(B) was
(C) were
(D) have been

**정답: C**

> If I **were you** = 내가 너라면

---

## Q3

The supplier sent an _____ for the equipment yesterday.

(A) expense
(B) reimbursement
(C) invoice
(D) contract

**정답: C**

→ 공급업체가 보낸 청구서 = invoice

---

## Q4

The two companies are currently _____ the terms of the agreement.

(A) negotiating
(B) reimbursing
(C) invoicing
(D) attending

**정답: A**

> negotiate the terms = 조건을 협상하다

---

## Q5

Employees can request _____ for approved business expenses.

(A) contracts
(B) invoices
(C) reimbursement
(D) negotiation

**정답: C**

→ 비용을 돌려받는 것 = reimbursement

---

## 오늘의 Part 5 공식

> **If + 과거형 → would + 동사원형**
>
> **invoice = 청구서**
>
> **reimbursement = 비용 환급**
